        "original_id": "8289d8b2-6395-51c0-b7ff-d6fe60d1ce70",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: G. V. Prakash Kumar, Ashrita Shetty, Vetrimaaran, Manimaran, Vinod, Prashant Narayanan\n- Films: Veyyil, Udhayam NH4, Naan Thaan Siva\n- Companies: S Pictures\n- Roles: lead role, antagonist\n\nFacts:\n- S Pictures' film \"Veyyil\" (2006) was G. V. Prakash Kumar's first film.\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar became popular in Tamil cinema by the early 2010s.\n- Vetrimaaran and Manimaran approached Ashrita Shetty to play the lead role in their film \"Udhayam NH4\".\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar composed the soundtrack and background score for \"Udhayam NH4\".\n- The film \"Naan Thaan Siva\" features newcomer Vinod and Ashrita Shetty in the leading roles.\n- Prashant Narayanan portrays the antagonist in \"Naan Thaan Siva\".",
